    "details": "<p><strong>36-Hour Hackathon | VIBRANT 2K26:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Build &bull; Innovate &bull; Impact</strong></p>\n<p>The 36-Hour Hackathon is a flagship technology event under VIBRANT 2K26, organized by Vibeesta Creative Society &amp; Shrinik Club, G.L. Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management.</p>\n<p>Participants will compete through multiple stages, demonstrating their technical knowledge, innovation, problem-solving skills, and ability to build practical solutions for real-world challenges.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to college students across India.</li>\n<li>Students from any academic discipline can participate.</li>\n<li>Each team must consist of 2&ndash;4 members.</li>\n<li>A participant can be part of only one team.</li>\n<li>All participants must provide accurate registration details.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Competition Format:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &mdash; Online Assessment:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants will take an online assessment testing technical knowledge, logical reasoning, aptitude, and problem-solving skills.</li>\n<li>Qualified teams will advance to Round 2.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &mdash; PPT Submission:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Qualified teams will submit a PPT presenting their proposed solution.</li>\n<li>The PPT should cover:\n<ul>\n<li>Problem Statement.</li>\n<li>Proposed Solution.</li>\n<li>Innovation / USP.</li>\n<li>Technology Stack.</li>\n<li>Feasibility.</li>\n<li>Expected Impact.</li>\n<li>Scalability.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Selected teams will advance to the offline hackathon.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 3 &mdash; 36-Hour Hackathon:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shortlisted teams will participate in the 36-hour offline development challenge.</li>\n<li>Teams will:\n<ul>\n<li>Ideate &rarr; Build &rarr; Test &rarr; Refine &rarr; Submit &rarr; Demo.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "end_date": "2026-10-06T00:00:00+05:30",
